    {
      "dom_id": "question-121266",
      "name": "Question 7",
      "problem": "Which of the following is the graph of the polar curve $r=12\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta ?$",
      "worked_solution": "The polar equation $r=2a\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta $ defines a circle of radius $|a|$ centered at the point $(0,a).$\n\nIn our case, we have $r=12\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta ,$ and therefore\n\n$$\na=\\frac{12}{2}=6.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation $r=12\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta $ gives a circle of radius $|6|=6$ centered at the point $(0,6),$ as shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14225098/assets/adf3c76c7b9bcb1d1c8a917716bf6df70cf456d03db4ef8759b049686975bae3.png)",
      "answer_fields_complete": true,
      "result": "Incorrect",
      "html": "<div id=\"question-121266\" class=\"question\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">7.</span><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"121266\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>Which of the following is the graph of the polar curve <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"55\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c69\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2061\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D703 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3F\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>?</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> </p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyEasy\">E</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Thu, Oct 15th @ 12:20 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:17</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: red;\">Incorrect</span></span></div></div>",
