    {
      "dom_id": "question-17263",
      "name": "Question 10",
      "problem": "Which of the following is the graph of the polar curve $r=5\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta ?$",
      "worked_solution": "The polar equation $r=2a\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta $ defines a circle of radius $|a|$ centered at the point $(0,a).$\n\nIn our case, we have $r=5\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta ,$ and therefore\n\n$$\na=\\frac{5}{2}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation $r=5\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta $ gives a circle of radius $|\\frac{5}{2}|=\\frac{5}{2}$ centered at the point $(0,2.5),$ as shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14225098/assets/8375e6709a6a7f34183b821411aaa251341666f948164d498b012f07af744a45.png)",
      "answer_fields_complete": true,
      "result": "Correct",
      "html": "<div id=\"question-17263\" class=\"question\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">10.</span><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"17263\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>Which of the following is the graph of the polar curve <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"82\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c69\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2061\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D703 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3F\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>?</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyEasy\">E</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Thu, Oct 15th @ 12:22 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:18</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>",
