  "canonical_examples": [
    {
      "dom_id": "step-28345",
      "name": "Example: \n                    The Polar Equation of a Circle Centered on the X-Axis",
      "problem": "Plot the curve defined by the equation $r=2\\cos\\theta$ in polar coordinates.",
      "worked_solution": "The polar equation $r=2a\\cos\\theta$ defines a circle of radius $|a|$ centered at the point $(a,0).$\n\nIn our case, we have $r=2\\cos\\theta,$ and therefore\n\n$$\na = \\dfrac{2}{2} = 1.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation $r=2\\cos\\theta$ gives a circle of radius $\\left|1\\right| = 1$ centered at the point $(1,0),$ as shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14225098/assets/bc5f763522aec68e97bef90126866fe6b2fe7246560d4dc9ddd2c71a5a524d88.png)",
      "html": "<div id=\"step-28345\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"28345\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"7598\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-28345\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-2\">The Polar Equation of a Circle Centered on the X-Axis</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"28345\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n          