    {
      "dom_id": "step-19879",
      "name": "Example: \n                    The Polar Equation of a Circle Centered on the Y-Axis",
      "problem": "Plot the curve defined by the equation $r=4\\sin\\theta$ in polar coordinates.",
      "worked_solution": "The polar equation $r=2a\\sin\\theta$ defines a circle of radius $|a|$ centered at the point $(0,a).$\n\nIn our case, we have $r=4\\sin\\theta,$ and therefore\n\n$$\na = \\dfrac{4}{2} = 2.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation $r=4\\sin\\theta$ gives a circle of radius $\\left|2\\right| = 2$ centered at the point $(0,2),$ as shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14225098/assets/a6a1f74e065f3508c92f8a438eb1830aeb4f877c355cd7779e86183a0da92183.png)",
      "html": "<div id=\"step-19879\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"19879\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"5393\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-19879\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-6\">The Polar Equation of a Circle Centered on the Y-Axis</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"19879\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n          