      "html_path": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14225098/observations/step-e5394-5610043610147c0164b7.html",
      "screenshot": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14225098/observations/step-e5394-5610043610147c0164b7.png",
      "worked_solution": "The diagram shows a circle of radius $|a| = |-4.5|=4.5$ centered at the point $(0,-4.5).$ \n\nIn polar coordinates, the equation of such a circle is given by \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r & =2a\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =2\\cdot (-4.5)\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =-9\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta .\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "can_dont_know": false,
      "can_skip": false,
      "question": {
        "dom_id": "step-e5394",
        "name": "Example: Finding the Polar Equation of a Circle Given Its Graph",
        "problem": "What is the polar equation of the curve shown below?\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14225098/assets/0ad44bfa452da482fff5f579f1be9569670f7ad8da347314bcb63f618eaf3d2a.png)",
        "worked_solution": "The diagram shows a circle of radius $|a| = |-4.5|=4.5$ centered at the point $(0,-4.5).$ \n\nIn polar coordinates, the equation of such a circle is given by \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r & =2a\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =2\\cdot (-4.5)\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =-9\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta .\\end{aligned}\n$$",
        "calculator_instructions": "",
        "fields": [],
        "problem_field_keys": [],
        "answer_fields_complete": null,
        "result": null,
        "proof_feedback": null,
        "html": "<div id=\"step-e5394\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Finding the Polar Equation of a Circle Given Its Graph</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e5394\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <p>What is the polar equation of the curve shown below?</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-fb3e7cb97ab707e8a94a0dfb9c2bf215\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/fb3e7cb97ab707e8a94a0dfb9c2bf215\"></div>\n\n\n                    </div>     \n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleExplanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleExplanation\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n   