      "html_path": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14225098/observations/step-t13319-698207d2e9410fa97e05.html",
      "screenshot": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14225098/observations/step-t13319-698207d2e9410fa97e05.png",
      "worked_solution": "",
      "can_dont_know": false,
      "can_skip": false,
      "tutorial": {
        "dom_id": "step-t13319",
        "name": "Deriving the Polar Equation of a Circle Centered at (a,0)",
        "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14225098/assets/4632ae0baaced6ba3699fddf859b71226b5fcebe4700bbbdf4774d1d701e53ad.png)\n\nSuppose we want to derive the polar equation of a circle with\n\n- center at $(a, 0)$, where $a \\ne 0$, and\n\n- radius $|a|$, so that it passes through the origin.\n\nLet a point $P$ on the circle have polar coordinates $(r, \\theta)$. Then, the Cartesian coordinates of $P$ are\n\n$$\n(x, y) = (r\\cos\\theta, \\, r\\sin\\theta).\n$$\n\nThe distance from $P$ to the center $(a, 0)$ is equal to the radius $|a|.$ We can describe this using the distance formula:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{(r\\cos\\theta - a)^2 + (r\\sin\\theta)^2} = |a|\n$$\n\nSquaring both sides, we get\n\n$$\n(r\\cos\\theta - a)^2 + (r\\sin\\theta)^2 = a^2.\n$$\n\nExpanding both terms yields\n\n$$\nr^2\\cos^2\\theta - 2ar\\cos\\theta + a^2 + r^2\\sin^2\\theta = a^2.\n$$\n\nThen, we combine like terms:\n\n$$\nr^2(\\cos^2\\theta + \\sin^2\\theta) - 2ar\\cos\\theta + a^2 = a^2\n$$\n\nSince $\\cos^2\\theta + \\sin^2\\theta = 1$, we can simplify the above as follows:\n\n$$\nr^2 - 2ar\\cos\\theta + a^2 = a^2\n$$\n\nSubtracting $a^2$ from both sides gives\n\n$$\nr^2 - 2ar\\cos\\theta = 0.\n$$\n\nThen, we factor our equation:\n\n$$\nr(r - 2a\\cos\\theta) = 0\n$$\n\nSo, either $r = 0$ (which corresponds to the origin, already on the circle), or\n\n$$\nr = 2a\\cos\\theta,\n$$\n\nwhich is the desired polar equation of the circle.",
        "worked_solution": "",
        "calculator_instructions": "",
        "fields": [],
        "problem_field_keys": [],
        "answer_fields_complete": null,
        "result": null,
        "proof_feedback": null,
        "html": "<div id=\"step-t13319\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n               \n                <div class=\"tutorial\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Deriving the Polar Equation of a Circle Centered at (a,0)</span></div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"t13319\">?</div>\n                    </div>                    \n    \n                    <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;\n                            -moz-transition: none;\n                            -ms-transition: none;\n                            -o-transition: none\n                            }\n\n                            .mjx-svg-href {\n                            fill: blue;\n                            stroke: blue\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox {\n                            display: table!important\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {\n                            display: table-cell!important;\n                            width: 10000em!important;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage__block {\n                            text-align: center;\n                            margin: 1em 0em;\n                            position: relative;\n                            display: block!important;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            width: 100%\n                            }</style><div id=\"graphic-e8e161cc73f98b78d480bfe29225c76d\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/e8e161cc73f98b78d480bfe29225c76d\"></div>\n\n\n\n<p>Suppose we want to derive the polar equation of a circle with</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>center at <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"5.236ex\" height=\"2.843ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -863.1 2254.2 1223.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"Ma