        "dom_id": "step-19881",
        "html": "<div class=\"step\" contentid=\"5394\" id=\"step-19881\" stepid=\"19881\" steptype=\"example\" style=\"display: block\">\n<div class=\"stepHeader\">\n<div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a class=\"stepAnchor\" id=\"stepAnchor-19881\" name=\"step-9\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Finding the Polar Equation of a Circle Given Its Graph</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"19881\">?</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n<p>What is the polar equation of the curve shown below?</p>\n<div class=\"graphic\" id=\"graphic-fb3e7cb97ab707e8a94a0dfb9c2bf215\"><img src=\"/graphics/fb3e7cb97ab707e8a94a0dfb9c2bf215\"/></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div>\n<div class=\"exampleExplanation\">\n<style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\