        "html_path": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14225098/observations/step-q16469-a9022e7d3d89e6383d1b.html",
        "screenshot": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14225098/observations/step-q16469-a9022e7d3d89e6383d1b.png",
        "worked_solution": "The polar equation $r=2a\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta $ defines a circle of radius $|a|$ centered at the point $(a,0).$\n\nIn our case, we have $r=4\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta ,$ and therefore\n\n$$\na=\\frac{4}{2}=2.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation $r=4\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta $ gives a circle of radius $|2|=2$ centered at the point $(2,0),$ as shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14225098/assets/05996c6895718404008ed930e4410d7f410f946568721b06736bd7915afa88ba.png)",
        "can_dont_know": false,
        "can_skip": false,
        "question": {
          "dom_id": "step-q16469",
          "name": "Question 3",
          "problem": "Which of the following is the graph of the polar curve $r=4\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta ?$",
          "worked_solution": "The polar equation $r=2a\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta $ defines a circle of radius $|a|$ centered at the point $(a,0).$\n\nIn our case, we have $r=4\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta ,$ and therefore\n\n$$\na=\\frac{4}{2}=2.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation $r=4\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta $ gives a circle of radius $|2|=2$ centered at the point $(2,0),$ as shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14225098/assets/05996c6895718404008ed930e4410d7f410f946568721b06736bd7915afa88ba.png)",
          "calculator_instructions": "",
          "fields": [
            {
              "key": "selection",
              "type": "radio",
              "choices": [
                {
                  "option": "a",
                  "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-16469-a",
                  "type": "image",
                  "value": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14225098/assets/06c99a85fb7d6b56241d0f574424a47397698dc1bb0b9d15d6ba49637126fc8b.png",
                  "html": "<img src=\"/graphics/q-16469-a-3\">",
                  "source_url": "https://mathacademy.com/graphics/q-16469-a-3",
                  "source_urls": [
                    "https://mathacademy.com/graphics/q-16469-a-3"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "option": "b",
