          "worked_solution": "The diagram shows a circle of radius $a=1$ centered at the point $(0,1).$ \n\nIn polar coordinates, the equation of such a circle is given by \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r & =2a\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =2\\cdot 1\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta .\\end{aligned}\n$$",
