          "answer_fields_complete": true,
          "result": "Correct",
          "proof_feedback": null,
          "html": "<div id=\"step-q281499\" class=\"step questionWidget\" style=\"display: block;\"><div class=\"questionWidget-header\"><div class=\"questionWidget-title\">Question 15</div><div class=\"questionWidget-helpButton\">?</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-281499\"></div><div class=\"questionWidget-text\">The polar equation of the given curve is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"-1\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"122\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container><div id=\"freeResponseTextbox-1\" class=\"matheditor-wrapper-answer\" ;=\"\" style=\"min-width:80px;\n                                        margin-left:6px;\n                                        margin-right:1px;\n                                        background:;\"><div class=\"mq-editable-field mq-math-mode\" style=\"border: none; outline: none;\"><span class=\"mq-textarea\"><textarea autocapitalize=\"off\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" x-palm-disable-ste-all=\"true\" style=\"\" disabled=\"\"></textarea></span><span class=\"mq-root-block\" mathquill-block-id=\"14\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"16\" class=\"\">−</span><span mathquill-command-id=\"18\">3</span><var mathquill-command-id=\"21\" class=\"mq-operator-name mq-first\">s</var><var mathquill-command-id=\"22\" class=\"mq-operator-name\">i</var><var mathquill-command-id=\"23\" class=\"mq-operator-name mq-last\">n</var><var mathquill-command-id=\"25\">θ</var></span></div></div>.</div><div class=\"questionWidget-buttonBar\"><div class=\"questionWidget-su